    {
      "id": "F01",
      "result": "Full observed checkpoint executes before translating or rethrowing rule failures; actual disposal/stale work wins while unchanged rule throw stays RULE_FAILED."
    },
    {
      "id": "F02",
      "result": "Both native input/result structuredClone failures and then-result getter failure run full native/owner observation before error translation."
    },
    {
      "id": "F03",
      "result": "Existing private RuleRunner.validate/message gets optional prepare-only checkpoint, after conversion/actual validator/provider and on callback failure before later work. Ordinary callers pass no checkpoint and keep whole-list blank, rule receiver and error policy."
    },
    {
      "id": "F04",
      "result": "Preview synchronization captures association/graph/version and exits after root-focus supersession before reset-owner publication. Disposed/resuperseded focus path cannot re-add old preview listeners."
    },
    {
      "id": "F05",
      "result": "Unsupported parser result is classified/rejection drained before observed can exit with lifetime/stale error."
    },
    {
      "id": "F06",
      "result": "Local public validation increments nativeRevision only on actual retained.invalid change; unchanged inner validation does not invent supersession."
    },
    {
      "id": "F07",
      "result": "Rescan synchronizes preview again after issue/ARIA publication before marking reconciliation complete, covering deletion triggered while scanning."
    },
    {
      "id": "F08",
      "result": "Caught cause reaches prepare-owned observed(cause), which preserves exact same-owner FORM_DISPOSED/FORM_RESCAN/FORM_PREPARE guards without generic rule error unwrapping or ordinary validation change."
    }
  ],
  "accepted_contract_checks": [
    "prepare uses current compiled native fields only, safe nonoverlapping paths before getters/parsers, one coherent preparse/parsed record and detached mutable success result; invalid issues have values:null.",
    "Pure observation avoids localFieldValue/localValues/read/validate/reset flush and writes no Rows/drafts/binding/errors/native display itself; user callback actions remain application-owned.",
    "Rows native cache records actual successful written version/raw and selected occurrence metadata; unchanged raw skips parser, edited/draft candidates parse once, focused deferred source keeps actually shown raw.",
    "Native selection tokens preserve scalar type, signed zero, duplicates, selected option identity/raw ownership and disabled distinction; validation uses current owned catalog and detached native probes.",
    "Synchronous parser and rule failure paths preserve coded lifetime/structural/reentry priority, reject/drain unsupported parser thenables and reject stale owner/native/reset work without publication.",
    "Deleted loaded detail retains same Form/read/render owners and current source, independently of original deletion wire payload; locks only owned native fields, default validation skips preview but checks other drafts, prepare/explicit deleted validation reject appropriately.",
    "Preview reset uses existing owners/pending timer, permits shared native default action, restores only current affected successful native/typed shown state, never invokes format/value/whole hooks or writes Rows; canceled/synthetic/stale generations do not repaint.",
    "Existing rescan/group apply/rollback/retirement and unbind/disposal restore native flags/root status/tabindex/listeners; root focus supports native container ownership without inert or ancestor mutation.",
    "Shared assertNativePaths exactly reuses defaults duplicate/ancestor checks and errors; remains private to package internals.",
    "Exactly two old browser assertions now positively verify retained preview/catalog/value/locks/root marker while preserving original test titles and remaining null/missing/replacement/capture/no-hook/source assertions.",
